{"jmx_content":"<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\"?>\n<jmeterTestPlan version=\"1.2\" properties=\"5.0\" jmeter=\"5.6.3\">\n  <hashTree>\n    <TestPlan guiclass=\"TestPlanGui\" testclass=\"TestPlan\" testname=\"Plan de Prueba de Reserva\">\n      <elementProp name=\"TestPlan.user_defined_variables\" elementType=\"Arguments\" guiclass=\"ArgumentsPanel\" testclass=\"Arguments\" testname=\"User Defined Variables\">\n        <collectionProp name=\"Arguments.arguments\"/>\n      </elementProp>\n      <stringProp name=\"TestPlan.comments\"></stringProp>\n      <boolProp name=\"TestPlan.functional_mode\">false</boolProp>\n      <boolProp name=\"TestPlan.tearDown_on_shutdown\">true</boolProp>\n      <boolProp name=\"TestPlan.serialize_threadgroups\">false</boolProp>\n    </TestPlan>\n    <hashTree>\n      <Arguments guiclass=\"ArgumentsPanel\" testclass=\"Arguments\" testname=\"User Defined Variables\" enabled=\"true\">\n        <collectionProp name=\"Arguments.arguments\">\n          <elementProp name=\"host\" elementType=\"Argument\">\n            <stringProp name=\"Argument.name\">host</stringProp>\n            <stringProp name=\"Argument.value\">api.example.com</stringProp>\n            <stringProp name=\"Argument.metadata\">=</stringProp>\n          </elementProp>\n          <elementProp name=\"scheme\" elementType=\"Argument\">\n            <stringProp name=\"Argument.name\">scheme</stringProp>\n            <stringProp name=\"Argument.value\">https</stringProp>\n            <stringProp name=\"Argument.metadata\">=</stringProp>\n          </elementProp>\n        </collectionProp>\n      </Arguments>\n      <hashTree/>\n      <ConfigTestElement guiclass=\"HttpDefaultsGui\" testclass=\"ConfigTestElement\" testname=\"HTTP Request Defaults\" enabled=\"true\">\n        <elementProp name=\"HTTPsampler.Arguments\" elementType=\"Arguments\">\n          <collectionProp name=\"Arguments.arguments\"/>\n        </elementProp>\n        <stringProp name=\"HTTPSampler.domain\">${host}</stringProp>\n        <stringProp name=\"HTTPSampler.port\"></stringProp>\n        <stringProp name=\"HTTPSampler.protocol\">${scheme}</stringProp>\n        <stringProp name=\"HTTPSampler.contentEncoding\"></stringProp>\n        <stringProp name=\"HTTPSampler.path\"></stringProp>\n        <stringProp name=\"HTTPSampler.concurrentPool\">6</stringProp>\n      </ConfigTestElement>\n      <hashTree/>\n      <CookieManager guiclass=\"CookiePanel\" testclass=\"CookieManager\" testname=\"HTTP Cookie Manager\" enabled=\"true\">\n        <collectionProp name=\"CookieManager.cookies\"/>\n        <boolProp name=\"CookieManager.clearEachIteration\">true</boolProp>\n      </CookieManager>\n      <hashTree/>\n      <CacheManager guiclass=\"CacheManagerGui\" testclass=\"CacheManager\" testname=\"HTTP Cache Manager\" enabled=\"true\">\n        <boolProp name=\"clearEachIteration\">true</boolProp>\n        <boolProp name=\"useExpires\">true</boolProp>\n      </CacheManager>\n      <hashTree/>\n      <ThreadGroup guiclass=\"ThreadGroupGui\" testclass=\"ThreadGroup\" testname=\"Grupo de Hilos de Reserva\" enabled=\"true\">\n        <stringProp name=\"ThreadGroup.on_sample_error\">continue</stringProp>\n        <elementProp name=\"ThreadGroup.main_controller\" elementType=\"LoopController\" guiclass=\"LoopControlPanel\" testclass=\"LoopController\" testname=\"Loop Controller\">\n          <boolProp name=\"LoopController.continue_forever\">false</boolProp>\n          <stringProp name=\"LoopController.loops\">1</stringProp>\n        </elementProp>\n        <stringProp name=\"ThreadGroup.num_threads\">10</stringProp>\n        <stringProp name=\"ThreadGroup.ramp_time\">30</stringProp>\n        <longProp name=\"ThreadGroup.start_time\">1697040000000</longProp>\n        <longProp name=\"ThreadGroup.end_time\">1697040000000</longProp>\n        <boolProp name=\"ThreadGroup.scheduler\">false</boolProp>\n        <stringProp name=\"ThreadGroup.duration\"></stringProp>\n        <stringProp name=\"ThreadGroup.delay\"></stringProp>\n      </ThreadGroup>\n      <hashTree>\n        <HTTPSamplerProxy guiclass=\"HttpTestSampleGui\" testclass=\"HTTPSamplerProxy\" testname=\"1. Crear Reserva\" enabled=\"true\">\n          <elementProp name=\"HTTPsampler.Arguments\" elementType=\"Arguments\" guiclass=\"HTTPArgumentsPanel\" testclass=\"Arguments\" testname=\"User Defined Variables\">\n            <collectionProp name=\"Arguments.arguments\">\n              <elementProp name=\"\" elementType=\"HTTPArgument\">\n                <boolProp name=\"HTTPArgument.always_encode\">false</boolProp>\n                <stringProp name=\"Argument.value\">{\"firstname\":\"John\",\"lastname\":\"Doe\"}</stringProp>\n                <stringProp name=\"Argument.metadata\">=</stringProp>\n              </elementProp>\n            </collectionProp>\n          </elementProp>\n          <stringProp name=\"HTTPSampler.domain\">${host}</stringProp>\n          <stringProp name=\"HTTPSampler.port\"></stringProp>\n          <stringProp name=\"HTTPSampler.protocol\">${scheme}</stringProp>\n          <stringProp name=\"HTTPSampler.path\">/booking</stringProp>\n          <stringProp name=\"HTTPSampler.method\">POST</stringProp>\n          <boolProp name=\"HTTPSampler.postBodyRaw\">true</boolProp>\n          <stringProp name=\"HTTPSampler.follow_redirects\">true</stringProp>\n          <stringProp name=\"HTTPSampler.auto_redirects\">false</stringProp>\n          <stringProp name=\"HTTPSampler.use_keepalive\">true</stringProp>\n          <stringProp name=\"HTTPSampler.DO_MULTIPART_POST\">false</stringProp>\n          <stringProp name=\"HTTPSampler.monitor\">false</stringProp>\n          <stringProp name=\"HTTPSampler.embedded_url_re\"></stringProp>\n        </HTTPSamplerProxy>\n        <hashTree>\n          <HeaderManager guiclass=\"HeaderPanel\" testclass=\"HeaderManager\" testname=\"HTTP Header Manager\" enabled=\"true\">\n            <collectionProp name=\"HeaderManager.headers\">\n              <elementProp name=\"\" elementType=\"Header\">\n                <stringProp name=\"Header.name\">Content-Type</stringProp>\n                <stringProp name=\"Header.value\">application/json</stringProp>\n              </elementProp>\n            </collectionProp>\n          </HeaderManager>\n          <hashTree/>\n          <ResponseAssertion guiclass=\"AssertionGui\" testclass=\"ResponseAssertion\" testname=\"Verificar Código de Respuesta 201\" enabled=\"true\">\n            <collectionProp name=\"Asserion.test_strings\">\n              <stringProp name=\"201\">201</stringProp>\n            </collectionProp>\n            <stringProp name=\"Assertion.test_field\">Assertion.response_code</stringProp>\n            <boolProp name=\"Assertion.assume_success\">false</boolProp>\n            <intProp name=\"Assertion.test_type\">2</intProp>\n          </ResponseAssertion>\n          <hashTree/>\n        </hashTree>\n      </hashTree>\n      <ResultCollector guiclass=\"ViewResultsFullVisualizer\" testclass=\"ResultCollector\" testname=\"Ver Resultados\" enabled=\"false\">\n        <boolProp name=\"ResultCollector.error_logging\">false</boolProp>\n        <objProp>\n          <name>saveConfig</name>\n          <value class=\"SampleSaveConfiguration\">\n            <time>true</time>\n            <latency>true</latency>\n            <timestamp>true</timestamp>\n            <success>true</success>\n            <label>true</label>\n            <code>true</code>\n            <message>true</message>\n            <threadName>true</threadName>\n            <dataType>true</dataType>\n            <encoding>false</encoding>\n            <assertions>true</assertions>\n            <subresults>true</subresults>\n            <responseData>false</responseData>\n            <samplerData>false</samplerData>\n            <xml>false</xml>\n            <fieldNames>true</fieldNames>\n            <responseHeaders>false</responseHeaders>\n            <requestHeaders>false</requestHeaders>\n            <responseDataOnError>false</responseDataOnError>\n            <saveAssertionResultsFailureMessage>true</saveAssertionResultsFailureMessage>\n            <assertionsResultsToSave>0</assertionsResultsToSave>\n            <bytes>true</bytes>\n            <sentBytes>true</sentBytes>\n            <url>true</url>\n            <threadCounts>true</threadCounts>\n            <idleTime>true</idleTime>\n            <connectTime>true</connectTime>\n          </value>\n        </objProp>\n        <stringProp name=\"filename\"></stringProp>\n      </ResultCollector>\n      <hashTree/>\n      <ResultCollector guiclass=\"SummaryReport\" testclass=\"ResultCollector\" testname=\"Informe Resumido\" enabled=\"true\">\n        <boolProp name=\"ResultCollector.error_logging\">false</boolProp>\n        <objProp>\n          <name>saveConfig</name>\n          <value class=\"SampleSaveConfiguration\">\n            <time>true</time>\n            <latency>true</latency>\n            <timestamp>true</timestamp>\n            <success>true</success>\n            <label>true</label>\n            <code>true</code>\n            <message>true</message>\n            <threadName>true</threadName>\n            <dataType>true</dataType>\n            <encoding>false</encoding>\n            <assertions>true</assertions>\n            <subresults>true</subresults>\n            <responseData>false</responseData>\n            <samplerData>false</samplerData>\n            <xml>false</xml>\n            <fieldNames>true</fieldNames>\n            <responseHeaders>false</responseHeaders>\n            <requestHeaders>false</requestHeaders>\n            <responseDataOnError>false</responseDataOnError>\n            <saveAssertionResultsFailureMessage>true</saveAssertionResultsFailureMessage>\n            <assertionsResultsToSave>0</assertionsResultsToSave>\n            <bytes>true</bytes>\n            <sentBytes>true</sentBytes>\n            <url>true</url>\n            <threadCounts>true</threadCounts>\n            <idleTime>true</idleTime>\n            <connectTime>true</connectTime>\n          </value>\n        </objProp>\n        <stringProp name=\"filename\"></stringProp>\n      </ResultCollector>\n      <hashTree/>\n    </hashTree>\n  </hashTree>\n</jmeterTestPlan>","explanation":"Para este test plan, he diseñado un script JMeter que realiza una solicitud POST al endpoint https://api.example.com/booking. El script incluye todos los componentes necesarios para realizar una prueba de carga con 10 usuarios y un tiempo de ramp-up de 30 segundos. A continuación, te proporciono una breve descripción de los componentes incluidos y el script JMX completo.\n\n### Descripción del Test Plan\n1. **Test Plan**: Define el plan de prueba con un nombre descriptivo.\n2. **User Defined Variables**: Contiene las variables para el host y el esquema.\n3. **HTTP Request Defaults**: Establece el dominio y el protocolo por defecto.\n4. **HTTP Cookie Manager**: Gestiona las cookies durante la prueba.\n5. **HTTP Cache Manager**: Gestiona la caché para evitar resultados inconsistentes.\n6. **Thread Group**: Configura el número de usuarios y el tiempo de ramp-up.\n7. **HTTP Sampler**: Realiza la solicitud POST con el body JSON y los headers necesarios.\n8. **Response Assertion**: Verifica que el código de respuesta sea 201.\n9. **View Results Tree** y **Summary Report**: Proporcionan informes y resultados de la prueba.\n\n### JMX Completo\n\n\n\n### Notas\n- Asegúrate de tener JMeter 5.6.3 o superior para garantizar la compatibilidad con el archivo JMX.\n- No se requieren archivos CSV para esta prueba, ya que los datos de prueba están incrustados directamente en el script.\n- Puedes modificar los valores de `firstname` y `lastname` directamente en el script si es necesario.","is_valid":true,"error":null,"components":[{"type":"Test Plan","name":"Plan de Prueba de Reserva","props":{}},{"type":"User Defined Variables","name":"User Defined Variables","props":{}},{"type":"User Defined Variables","name":"User Defined Variables","props":{}},{"type":"HTTP Request Defaults","name":"HTTP Request Defaults","props":{"HTTPSampler.domain":"${host}","HTTPSampler.port":"","HTTPSampler.protocol":"${scheme}","HTTPSampler.path":""}},{"type":"HTTP Cookie Manager","name":"HTTP Cookie Manager","props":{}},{"type":"HTTP Cache Manager","name":"HTTP Cache Manager","props":{}},{"type":"Thread Group","name":"Grupo de Hilos de Reserva","props":{"ThreadGroup.num_threads":"10","ThreadGroup.ramp_time":"30","ThreadGroup.duration":""}},{"type":"Loop Controller","name":"Loop Controller","props":{"LoopController.loops":"1"}},{"type":"HTTP Sampler","name":"1. Crear Reserva","props":{"HTTPSampler.domain":"${host}","HTTPSampler.port":"","HTTPSampler.protocol":"${scheme}","HTTPSampler.path":"/booking","HTTPSampler.method":"POST"}},{"type":"User Defined Variables","name":"User Defined Variables","props":{}},{"type":"HTTP Header Manager","name":"HTTP Header Manager","props":{}},{"type":"Response Assertion","name":"Verificar Código de Respuesta 201","props":{"Assertion.test_field":"Assertion.response_code"}},{"type":"Listener","name":"Ver Resultados","props":{"filename":""}},{"type":"Listener","name":"Informe Resumido","props":{"filename":""}}]}